  "comment": "Linux: With a SD card inserted, open a terminal window. At the prompt, type df, and press enter. The windows will report the device name of your SD card, it should look something like /dev/sdb1. Unmount the SD card, but leave it in the computer. Type sudo mkdosfs -F 16 /dev/sdb1 replacing the device name with yours. Remove the SD card and replace it to verify it works.",
